abstract: "CARTOGRAFFECT v3.0.0 Research Compendium: Strate 0 centers on Lean 4 (v4.35.0, Lake 5.0.0, Init only) as single reference formal prover across 8 normative modules (Cartograffect/) certifying 148 substantial theorems (169 exported declarations, 21 elementary lemmas, 8 pillar theorems, 0 sorryAx, 0 native_decide, 0 custom axioms; FORMAL_AUDIT_PACK.md), the dedicated extension PredictiveEngineCanonical.lean (16 own theorems + 5 auxiliaries = 21 declarations), the isomorphic exact integer Python engine (11 unit tests), and the theoretical manuscript (docs/01-Article_Cartograffect.md, continuous Z in [0, 5], canonical discretization Z in {0, 1, 2}, Option 1A strict instrumental Y with decoupled A >= 0, predictions P1-P5). Exploratory annexes (Cartograffect/Lexicon176.lean, docs/02-Inventaire_176.md, Strate 1 lexicon/in_silico satellites, frozen v2.1.0 multi-prover archive) remain strictly separated from the normative core. Code is licensed solely under AGPL-3.0-or-later; texts, manuscript, documentation, and taxonomic tables are licensed under CC-BY-4.0."
